# Starving Revenant: binning both surveiled cards puts nothing on top, so it draws nothing and loses no life (20): "for each card you
# put on top of your library". Lightning Bolt and Counterspell go to the graveyard (ten cards there, eight of them permanents). The
# Descend 8 ability only triggers on Bot1's own draws: Bot2's turn-2 draw drains nothing (both at 20), Bot1's turn-3 draw does (Bot2
# at 19, Bot1 at 21).

